Subject: [PATCH 5/6] inkling2 : fuse the conv state store with the static
 short convolution

CONCAT VIEW VIEW CPY SSM_CONV RESHAPE ADD SCALE in one kernel for one sequence; the concat is never
written. Correct (test INK_conv) but no measurable gain on the VII, where two small dependent kernels
in a HIP graph cost about as much as one. GGML_INK_NO_CATCONV=1 turns it off. Also adds flash
attention and conv perf cases.
